@startuml Client Thread Model

title Client: Traad-kommunikation (NotePi eksempel)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 10

participant "Qt Main Thread\n(UI + event loop\n+ netvaerk)" as QT
participant "NoteReader Thread\n(audio + pitch)" as AUDIO

== Opstart ==
QT -> QT: app.exec() starter Qt event loop
QT -> QT: lobby->connectToServer()\n(QTcpSocket — non-blocking)
QT -> AUDIO: noteReader.start()\n-> std::thread(NoteReader::loop)

== Lobby-flow (alt i Qt main thread) ==
QT -> QT: QTcpSocket::connected signal\n-> sender create_room/join_room
QT -> QT: QTcpSocket::readyRead signal\n-> parser room_created, player_joined
QT -> QT: lobby->requestStartWithGame("notepi")\n-> skriver direkte til socket
QT -> QT: readyRead -> parser role_assigned\n-> viser RoleScreen

== Spilstart ==
QT -> QT: QTimer::singleShot(500ms)\n-> game->connectToServer()
QT -> QT: QTcpSocket::connected\n-> sender identify

== Performer spiller tone ==
AUDIO -> AUDIO: CoreAudio callback\n-> ring buffer\n-> aubio pitch\n-> "A" detekteret

AUDIO -[#blue]-> QT: **QMetaObject::invokeMethod**\n(&window, [note="A"]{...},\nQt::QueuedConnection)
note right of AUDIO: Lambda postes til\nQt event queue.\nAudio-traad blokerer IKKE.

QT -> QT: Lambda koerer:\nwindow.addDetectedNote("A")\n-> NotePiScreen viser "A"

== Performer trykker SUBMIT ==
QT -> QT: game->submitNotes(["A","C",...])\n-> socket_->write(...)\n(direkte — ingen mutex nødvendig)

== Server svarer ==
QT -> QT: QTcpSocket::readyRead signal\n-> parser note_state\n-> window.updateNoteState()\n(direkte — ingen invokeMethod)

note over QT: Netvaerks-callbacks korer\nallerede i Qt main thread,\nsa UI kan opdateres direkte.

== Game Over ==
QT -> QT: readyRead -> parser game_over\n-> gyro.stop()\n-> noteReader.stop()
QT -> AUDIO: running_ = false\nthread_.join()
note over AUDIO: Traaden stopper

QT -> QT: window.showGameOver(...)

note over QT: **GYLDEN REGEL:**\nUI maa KUN opdateres\nfra Qt main thread.\n\nNetvaerks-callbacks korer\nallerede der (via QTcpSocket).\n\nKun NoteReader bruger\ninvokeMethod + QueuedConnection\n(fordi den har sin egen traad).

@enduml
